\par Enjoy the outdoors? Whether you\rquote re ultra-competitive or just enjoy exploring the countryside, then a rogaine is for you. You\rquote ll be travelling by foot in a team (of 2 \endash  5 people
), using a 1:50,000 scale map to navigate to control points. Each control has a pre-allocated score value and the object is to locate as many controls as possible within the time allowed, to maximise your total score.
\par 
\par }{\b0\scaps Sounds like your sort of thing?
\par }{\b0 
\par }{\scaps Where is it?}{  }{\b0 We have selected a very spectacular piece of Hawke\rquote s Bay countryside, off the beaten track, for you to explore. The rogaine is being held in the Puketitiri area, which is approximately 60km north - west of Napier. 
There will be camping (including hot showers) available at the event centre on Friday (from 5.00pm) and Saturday nights.
\par 
\par }{\scaps What time does it start?}{ }{\b0  There will be three time options \endash  12, 8 and 4 hours. All courses will finish at 7.00pm and there will be planning time allowed before your \ldblquote race\rdblquote 
 time starts. Maps will be available at the following times:
\par }\pard \s16\qj\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tqr\tx4678\tqr\tx6521\adjustright {\b0 \tab 12-hour\tab 6.00am
\par \tab 8-hour\tab 10.00am
\par \tab 4-hour\tab 2.00pm
\par 
\par }{\scaps What happens after the event?}{\b0  Afterwards, it\rquote s time to relax and enjoy the evening. A meal will be provided at approximately 8.15pm, scores will be tallied and stories shared.
\par 
\par }{\scaps What categories are there}{?}{\b0  Men (M), Women (W) and Mixed (X)
\par 
\par }{\scaps How much does it cost?}{\b0  Your entry fee includes camping, a map and a meal. Per person, the fee is:
\par \tab 12-hour \tab $30
\par \tab 8-hour\tab $25
\par \tab 4-hour\tab $20
\par \tab Junior (20 & under)\tab $15 
\par 
